      <title>Wyoming is asking the USDA to ban candy and soda from SNAP</title>
      <link>https://www.wyomingpublicmedia.org/politics-government/2026-02-13/wyoming-is-asking-the-usda-to-ban-candy-and-soda-from-snap</link>
      <description>Gov. Mark Gordon’s office submitted a waiver last month to the federal government for approval to ban people from using SNAP benefits to purchase soda and candy. That’s as a bill to try and create more restrictions on spices and other ingredients failed to gain momentum during the first week of the budget session in Cheyenne.</description>
